{
  "model": "IndexTeam/IndexTTS-2.5",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "pause_seconds": 0.7,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "s14-p01",
      "text": "Children are known for wanting answers to many questions, because curiosity is part of human nature.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p02",
      "text": "They wonder why air cannot be seen.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p03",
      "text": "They ask why tape can hold different things together.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p03.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p04",
      "text": "Books and TV shows, including cartoons, often depend on curiosity.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p04.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p05",
      "text": "People keep reading or watching because they want to find out what happens.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p05.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p06",
      "text": "Curiosity provides many advantages.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p06.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p07",
      "text": "If you develop the curiosity of learning, classes will become more interesting.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p07.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p08",
      "text": "You will be good at them because you enjoy the process of learning.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p08.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p09",
      "text": "Even if you're no longer a student, curiosity will make you an able worker.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p09.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p10",
      "text": "What will you do if you're not yet curious?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p10.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p11",
      "text": "Luckily, curiosity is a skill that can be improved.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p11.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p12",
      "text": "Often, the more you learn about a topic, the more interesting it becomes.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p12.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p13",
      "text": "To improve your curiosity, get information from as many sources as possible when you learn about a topic.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p13.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p14",
      "text": "At the same time, read all kinds of books, watch or listen to speeches, and ask questions.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p14.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p15",
      "text": "Don't always get information in the same way.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p15.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p16",
      "text": "Instead, learn to understand the facts that different people know.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p16.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p17",
      "text": "Don't assume you already know everything.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p17.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p18",
      "text": "Instead, search for other possibilities and opinions.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p18.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p18.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p19",
      "text": "Learning to paint can promote your creativity.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p19.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p19.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p20",
      "text": "Walking around your hometown or playing basketball at the playground on the weekend provides opportunities to ask and answer questions.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p20.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p20.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p21",
      "text": "Listening to an opera or visiting the market allows you to explore.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p21.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p21.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p22",
      "text": "And even a great ad on TV can inspire you.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p22.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p22.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p23",
      "text": "All these let you learn something, and other people are often happy to share their knowledge.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p23.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p23.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14-p24",
      "text": "Let's try to become people who are full of curiosity.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p24.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s14-p24.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "word_audio": "browser speech synthesis en-GB"
}
